":"Ultimatia may have control over time itself, but Crimson knows her powers must have a weakness. Uncover it, and all variables will be accounted for. Or so Crimson thinks.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10014498/screencap/65440d9793e4a.jpg"},{"title":"Act and Guilt","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17263","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"146493","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"51297","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"195459","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"417983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"105914","synopsis":"Ragna’s relentless assault forces Ultimatia on the defensive. Unaware of his identity, an unexpected emotion overtakes the dragon monarch as their battle rages on: Fear.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10014499/screencap/654cf0c699057.jpg"},{"title":"A Painful Blow","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17263","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"146493","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"51297","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"195459","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"417983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"106008","synopsis":"Ultimatia made an impossible choice and, with Nebulim out for their blood, Ragna and Crimson must now withdraw. However, they may have only exchanged one problem for another.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10014500/screencap/65563a5a3045a.jpg"},{"title":"Negotiation and True Nature","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17263","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider